{"title": "Formless Slaughter", "pageid": 30389, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Formless_Slaughter", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Formless Slaughter</b> is a passive feature that enhances the user's combat while the user is transformed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +1 to Attack and Damage rolls while shapeshifting or disguised. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Formless_Slaughter\"> Condition: Formless Slaughter </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Formless_Slaughter_(Condition)\" title=\"Formless Slaughter (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Formless Slaughter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Formless_Slaughter_(Condition)\" title=\"Formless Slaughter (Condition)\">Formless Slaughter</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature has a +1 bonus to Attack and Damage rolls while disguised or shapeshifted.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mutilated_Carapace\" title=\"Mutilated Carapace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mutilated_Carapace\" title=\"Mutilated Carapace\">Mutilated Carapace</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1190/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10317/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2124/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754660/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.452      1 Template:Passiv